      "updated": 1767032786198,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n1. System should be able to show popular hash tags in the last\n    1/5/15/60 minutes\n2. System should be able to aggregate hash tags by categories\n    like global/country/sports/politics etc.,\n\nNon Functional Requirements\n1. System should return updated data within < 10s\n2. System should be available\n3. System should be scalable\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n1. System should be able to show popular hash tags in the last\n    1/5/15/60 minutes\n2. System should be able to aggregate hash tags by categories\n    like global/country/sports/politics etc.,\n\nNon Functional Requirements\n1. System should return updated data within < 10s\n2. System should be available\n3. System should be scalable\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
